+        // camerabin's capture path renegotiates the source — the libcamera
+        // pipeline stops and restarts, the soft-ISP's AWB/AF convergence
+        // resets, and the stored frame comes out violet/defocused even when
+        // the viewfinder looked perfect (pinning image-capture-caps did not
